$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr00.wav')
$v.Speak('Welcome to SmartGarbage Chintalavalasa - the community waste management portal for the five wards of Chintalavalasa Gram Panchayat. Let me walk you through the live website, feature by feature.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr01.wav')
$v.Speak('This is the public homepage. Notice the helpline number 1800 119 9111 and the collection schedule quick search right at the top. As we scroll, you can see ward-wise collection days, the transparency statistics, and the community impact numbers - all live from the database.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr02.wav')
$v.Speak('Every citizen can check their ward''s collection schedule here. Pick a ward - watch as I select Ward 2, Junction - and the portal shows the pickup days, plus a machine learning overflow-risk prediction for the coming days. No phone calls, no guesswork.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr03.wav')
$v.Speak('Reporting a missed pickup takes under a minute. The form captures your ward, the location with automatic GPS, and a photo as proof. Every submission gets a tracking token, and duplicates within 100 metres or 30 minutes are rejected automatically.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr04.wav')
$v.Speak('Below every page sits the rescue strip: the WhatsApp fallback card that opens a saved chat, and the free toll-free grievance helpline 1800 119 9111. Citizens without internet are covered by the offline-first PWA.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr05.wav')
$v.Speak('The ward transparency dashboard is the accountability view: complaint counts by status, resolution times, and the waste-collection statistics for every ward - published openly for residents.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr06.wav')
$v.Speak('The impact page summarises the community''s environmental and social gains so far, and the contact page lists every way to reach the panchayat team - WhatsApp, the toll-free helpline, email, and a dedicated grievance form for formal complaints.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr07.wav')
$v.Speak('The About page explains the initiative and the five wards it serves. The FAQ page answers the common questions - what can be recycled, how Green Points work, and how PAYT billing is calculated.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr08.wav')
$v.Speak('Every complaint also gets a signed tracking link, so its status can never vanish. Staff sign-in is where security shows: a password plus a second factor - a six-digit one-time code that can arrive by email with one click, no SMS gateway required. Watch the worker sign in now; the one-time code screen is the gate to the worker and admin portals.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr09.wav')
$v.Speak('Logged in as a citizen, the dashboard shows Green Points earned for segregation, the eco-champions leaderboard, daily four-stream waste declarations, PAYT invoices with UPI payment and receipts, and real-time notifications when a complaint moves.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr10.wav')
$v.Speak('The worker portal opens after MFA. It shows today''s dispatch queue ranked by predicted fill, maintenance tasks, and the geofenced bin checklist - a bin can only be cleared on site, with a live after-photo as proof. Offload logs close the loop at the dump yard.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr11.wav')
$v.Speak('The admin control room is the operational brain: live bin telemetry with fire, methane and tilt alerts, SLA-escalating complaints, worker monitoring, OTA firmware pushes, audit trail, failed-job alerts, and one-click state compliance exports.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr12.wav')
$v.Speak('Back in the citizen portal - still signed in. The dashboard carries a bin status search, one-tap issue reporting, the cleanliness leaderboard, and the daily segregation declaration: wet, dry, sanitary and hazardous waste in kilograms. Watch me declare today''s waste and submit it - the weights feed the household''s Green Points and the ward''s pay-as-you-throw billing.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr13.wav')
$v.Speak('Notification preferences: the citizen chooses which events trigger a push notification - complaint submitted, assigned, in progress, resolved or escalated, schedule reminders, Green Points earned, and a weekly summary. I''ll switch the weekly summary on and save.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr14.wav')
$v.Speak('Pay-as-you-throw billing. This is the outstanding August invoice - 363 rupees, billed on 62.9 percent segregation compliance with the penalty multiplier shown openly. The citizen pays by UPI or card through Razorpay right here, and every settled invoice has a downloadable PDF receipt.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr15.wav')
$v.Speak('Every complaint gets a signed tracking link - the tracking page explains how to use it, how to reopen a resolved complaint, and how to rate the resolution. Under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act a citizen can also file a right-to-erasure request here, which lands in the admin queue.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr16.wav')
$v.Speak('The worker''s side of the loop. A driver can raise a bin issue - damage or blockage - straight from the portal instead of by phone, and at the end of the round logs the offload at the dump yard, which closes the collection record for that truck.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr17.wav')
$v.Speak('Admin operations, continued. OTA firmware management pushes ESP32 and Arduino updates to the bins over Wi-Fi, with a release history and a per-bin connectivity report - no physical access needed. The offline deliveries view audits complaints and photos that arrived through the PWA queue, and the dead-letter queue exposes background jobs that exhausted their retry budget.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr18.wav')
$v.Speak('This is the photo gate''s feedback loop: uploads the anti-fake-report model refused land here so an admin can relabel a false positive, and the relabelled set downloads as the next retraining batch. Behind everything sits the immutable audit trail - tamper-proof, with every action from all three roles recorded.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr19.wav')
$v.Speak('The analytics and compliance hub: predictive collection heatmaps, an ESG compliance audit, the carbon-footprint tracker and circular-economy reports - plus one-click exports, the state portal compliance file, the CSRD export and a performance PDF.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr20.wav')
$v.Speak('Governance. The deletion queue lists right-to-erasure requests with their acknowledge and completion deadlines, and the super-admin console is the only place a new administrator account can be created - public registration never grants a staff role.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr21.wav')
$v.Speak('Registration is open to citizens, and the informal waste picker register is a flow of its own: recognition under Swachh Bharat Mission Phase Two for the people who already keep the ward clean.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr22.wav')
$v.Speak('Bulk waste generators - hotels, shops, institutions - declare their waste in the BWG ledger, which drives the panchayat''s bulk collection approvals. And site-wide search jumps straight to any of these services.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr23.wav')
$v.Speak('Rural connectivity is the default, so the offline page states exactly what still works - draft a report now, it syncs when the signal returns. Cookie settings give granular consent, and the ward satisfaction report ranks all five wards by the ratings citizens give after a resolution.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr24.wav')
$v.Speak('Illegal dumping has its own anonymous channel: an eyewitness files a dump report with a photo and the location, and the system strips EXIF and never stores who reported it. If a complaint is mishandled, the grievance page names the redressal officer and the order in which a grievance escalates.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr25.wav')
$v.Speak('Filing and tracking, end to end. The report form takes the ward, the address and the description, and tags the exact device coordinates - GPS is mandatory, so a report cannot be filed from nowhere. On submit the citizen lands on the signed tracking page: the live status timeline, the ward''s SLA window, the one-tap reopen if a resolution does not hold, and the satisfaction rating once it closes. Back on the dashboard the complaint is listed with its tracking link.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr26.wav')
$v.Speak('The legal and inclusion layer. The privacy policy sets out what the portal collects and why under the data-protection framework, the terms of service state the rules of use, and the accessibility statement publishes the WCAG commitments - keyboard support, heading structure and contrast.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr27.wav')
$v.Speak('Account recovery, for the moment a password or the verification mail goes missing: a citizen enters the username and the portal mails a single-use reset link, or, if the verification email never arrived, asks for a fresh verification link against the address on the account. Both links are for one use only.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr28.wav')
$v.Speak('SmartGarbage is an installable Progressive Web App. On a phone, the browser offers an install button; after that the app opens full-screen and keeps working without internet - pages are cached and complaints filed offline sync automatically when connectivity returns.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr29.wav')
$v.Speak('Under the hood: GitHub pushes auto-deploy to Render, PostgreSQL runs on Supabase, Cloudflare serves the edge, and GitHub Actions pings the health endpoint every fifteen minutes. The entire stack is free-tier.')
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile($null)
$v.SetOutputToWaveFile('C:/Users/chand/SmartGarbage/report/video/_video_live/narr30.wav')
$v.Speak('That is SmartGarbage - schedules, complaints, transparency, machine learning dispatch, gamification and billing, all bilingual in English and Telugu, running at zero cost for the panchayat. Thank you.')
